    "caveats": [
      "Wall shear stress of ~0.63 Pa is well above the hepatic sinusoidal range (0.05-0.15 Pa) and at the upper end of microvascular endothelium (0.1-1 Pa); confirm the intended cell type tolerates this shear.",
      "The viscosity of 0.0035 Pa·s is ~3.5× water-like medium; verify this is the actual medium viscosity as it directly scales shear and pressure drop.",
